# Cached card thumbnails (fetched from pokemontcg.io, regenerable).
# LEADING SLASH IS LOAD-BEARING: a bare `images/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded the Java package
# src/main/java/com/cardtracker/images/ - the importer source went
# uncommitted for a full day before anyone noticed.
/images/
